== Trivia ==
* [[anti:2Spooky|2Spooky]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Antibirth'', it also would cosmetically change Isaac's tears to red.
** In ''Community Remix'', it would instead have a 1/10 chance to trigger a room-wide fear effect after killing an enemy.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* The name and pickup quote are a reference to the "2spooky4me" meme. Isaac's appearance also makes him appear similar to popular internet horror images, such as Squidward's Suicide and Giygas from Earthbound.

